  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "My manservant returned. Well, my manservant WAS returned. Thankfully, none of my peers saw me take delivery of the crate, or dispose of the remains. I was expecting this, of course; Helions are known to shoot the messenger. It proves that we the clients are committed, knowing we are sending a trusted employee to their doom.",
    "value": "我的仆从回来了。嗯，该说我的仆从“被送回来”了。庆幸的是，没有同僚目睹我签收那个板条箱，或是处理遗骸。我对此早有预料；众所周知，赫利恩惯于射杀信使。这恰恰证明了委托方的决心，明知是派信任的仆从赴死，我们亦在所不惜。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Barbaric but necessary. So my contract was accepted, and now I have to wait. Helions are known for their promptness. The assassin could be here any day. Maybe they already are. Their stealth capabilities are unrivalled. It's somewhat disconcerting.",
    "value": "野蛮，但必要。如此，我的契约已被接受，现在只需等待。赫利恩以迅捷著称。杀手随时可能现身。或许已然在此。他们的潜行能力无与伦比。这念头，令人稍感不安。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "Larbeaks will regret messing with me, during her split-second realisation. I've told the Helion to ensure she knows where the hit came from. I will not be trifled with.",
    "value": "在大喙意识到真相的那一瞬间，她必将后悔与我为敌。我已吩咐赫利恩的刺客，务必让她知晓这场袭击源自何处。我，绝非可任人轻侮之辈。"
  }
]